# Data / solves (large; regenerable). Anchored to the repo root on purpose:
# unanchored, `data/` also matched web/rung1-viz/src/data/solve.json, which is
# committed source the visualizer imports — the deploy would have built green
# and served a page with no solve in it.
/data/
/solves/

